{
  "name": "Shuffll Engage - Create a campaign without rendering",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "3cba784e-b789-4014-8094-9302a3449625",
      "name": "Setup and limitations",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        40,
        -380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Create a campaign draft\n\nConfigure a private **Templated Custom Auth** credential on every HTTP node. Template: `{\"headers\":{\"Authorization\":\"Bearer {{api_key}}\"}}`. Store your workspace-scoped key only in the credential secret field. A paid Shuffll subscription and enabled API access are required.\n\nRequires `campaigns:write`. Replace every input before running. Select an authorized immutable template version reporting `render_source_status: ready` and supported `flat-video-v1` content. Choose a unique `idempotencyKey` per intended campaign; retain that key for uncertain retries. This performs a write but does not add recipients, render, export or send. The response is an operation job: queued/running is not success. Follow its job ID with the jobs API until terminal and inspect the result. Fixed-video campaigns do not personalize video from contact fields.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7cb0df7e-3e00-46b3-aabf-a8c83ccedcb5",
      "name": "Run manually",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "02b122f4-5684-4a8c-9536-13075f316ada",
      "name": "Campaign inputs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "46f72fe4-ccad-4d6c-a077-db52fcc33c31",
              "name": "organizationId",
              "value": "REPLACE_WITH_ORGANIZATION_UUID",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "5e4824bd-e817-4c24-8d28-d6662e7ec52c",
              "name": "templateId",
              "value": "REPLACE_WITH_TEMPLATE_UUID",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "e43a29b0-52ef-4bb9-ba56-fd5ced97dbd4",
              "name": "templateVersionId",
              "value": "REPLACE_WITH_READY_VERSION_UUID",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b4d7010d-74bd-4b4c-b91b-e42e88c126d8",
              "name": "campaignName",
              "value": "My video campaign",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f2733cba-18da-41f3-967b-946ba2da2b57",
              "name": "idempotencyKey",
              "value": "REPLACE_WITH_A_UNIQUE_KEY_FOR_THIS_CAMPAIGN",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c7d192c5-7b9f-43fe-80dd-76986f7a1524",
      "name": "Submit draft campaign",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        540,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://engage.shuffll.com/api/v1/campaigns",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpTemplatedCustomAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000,
          "redirect": {
            "redirect": {
              "followRedirects": false
            }
          },
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "={{ $json.idempotencyKey }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({organization_id: $json.organizationId, template_id: $json.templateId, template_version_id: $json.templateVersionId, name: $json.campaignName}) }}"
      }
    }
  ],
